            <h2>Integrating Project-Based Learning in Middle School Years Program: Action Research and Design Experiment From India</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8">
              <p class="h6 mb-3">Author(s): Monal Jayaram Poduval, Piramal Foundation; Jigna Nawani, Piramal Foundation; Neha Rana; Sandeep Saini; Kuldeep Dantewadia</p>
              <p class="h6">Chicago, IL | April 13, 2023</p>
            </div>
